<p>A <code>ContentsListItem</code> is a plain <code>&lt;li&gt;</code>
  wrapper that typically contains a <code>ContentsLink</code>.</p>

<p>When the item represents the reader's current page location
  (via scroll-spy or server-side resolution), set
  <code>current: true</code> so the list item gets
  <code>aria-current="location"</code>.</p>

<p>See the <a href="/components/contents-nav/">Contents Nav demo</a>
  for a composed example.</p>

{# BEGIN generated: examples (bin/generate-examples) #}
<h2>Usage</h2>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>{% raw %}&lt;ContentsList&gt;
  &lt;ContentsListItem aria-current="page"&gt;
    What is type 2 diabetes?
  &lt;/ContentsListItem&gt;
  &lt;ContentsListItem&gt;
    &lt;ContentsLink href="/conditions/type-2-diabetes/symptoms"&gt;Symptoms&lt;/ContentsLink&gt;
  &lt;/ContentsListItem&gt;
  &lt;ContentsListItem&gt;
    &lt;ContentsLink href="/conditions/type-2-diabetes/getting-diagnosed"&gt;Getting diagnosed&lt;/ContentsLink&gt;
  &lt;/ContentsListItem&gt;
&lt;/ContentsList&gt;
{% endraw %}</code></pre>
